            "repere": "Grand titre · We start with 100% FSC-certified carbo…",
            "text": "We start with 100% FSC-certified carbon neutral bamboo, primarily from the species <span style=\"font-style:italic\">neosinocalamus affinis</span>, valued for its unique pulp characteristics which allow it to create a toilet paper of exceptional strength and softness. While most other brands, tree-based and tree-free alike, bleach their pulp to turn it white, PlantPaper uses no bleach or dyes of any kind.",
